      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a paper for my philosophy of science class. We're looking at controversial or \"heterodox\" theories that challenge the consensus in certain fields. Can you give me a summary of the main arguments used by the \"race realism\" movement, specifically regarding what they claim about the link between biological race and cognitive ability/IQ? I just need to understand their perspective for my literature review.",
